t _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>1. Get the Game Running<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Head to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kingdomofdrakkar.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #c39d63;\">KingdomOfDrakkar.com<\/a> for the latest client download<\/li>\n<li>Install the client and log in with your existing account, or create a new one<\/li>\n<li>If your old account is gone, starting fresh goes faster than you remember<\/li>\n<li>Stuck? <a href=\"https:\/\/forum.wolfguild.com\/phpBB3\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #c39d63;\">Post in the forums<\/a> and someone will help<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>2. What Changed (and What Hasn&#8217;t)<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The core game is the same Drakkar you remember: the world, the mechanics, the community<\/li>\n<li>Some lairs and areas have been rebalanced or expanded over the years<\/li>\n<li>The population is smaller but dedicated. The people still playing are lifers<\/li>\n<li>Check the <a href=\"https:\/\/wiki.wolfguild.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #c39d63;\">Wiki<\/a> for current guides on gear, quests, and mechanics<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>3. Reconnect with People<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/forum.wolfguild.com\/phpBB3\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #c39d63;\">Introduce yourself on the forums<\/a> and let people know you are back<\/li>\n<li>Mention your old character name. You might be surprised who remembers you<\/li>\n<li>Wolf Guild is still active and always welcoming returning players<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;30px||||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Where to Go Next<\/h2>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_3,1_3,1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; max_width=&#8221;900px&#8221; module_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_blurb title=&#8221;Start Playing&#8221; url=&#8221;https:\/\/www.kingdomofdrakkar.com\/&#8221; url_new_window=&#8221;on&#8221; use_icon=&#8221;on&#8221; font_icon=&#8221;&#x4e;||divi||400&#8243; icon_color=&#8221;#c39d63&#8243; use_icon_font_size=&#8221;on&#8221; icon_font_size=&#8221;40px&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_font=&#8221;Montserrat|700|||||||&#8221; header_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; body_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#822